# S3 fixture ("created as Excel shows it"): page setup through s3-print's Page Setup (its script
# op): landscape on Letter (Excel on this PC exports A4 sheets on Letter), fit to one page, narrow
# margins, centered, a header and a footer, print titles, a print area and gridlines.
sheet-name "Print"
enter A1 "Month"
enter B1 "Sales"
enter A2 "Jan"
fill-series A2:A13
enter B2 "1200"
enter B3 "=B2+150"
fill-down B3:B13
pagesetup orientation=landscape
pagesetup paper=1
pagesetup fit=1,1
pagesetup margins=narrow
pagesetup center=h
pagesetup header=&CSales report
pagesetup footer=&CPage &P of &N
pagesetup rows=1:1
pagesetup area=A1:B13
pagesetup gridlines=1
save
expect pagesetup Print orientation 2 zoom False wide 1 tall 1 titlerows $1:$1 titlecols  area $A$1:$B$13
expect cell Print!A13 text Dec
expect cell Print!B13 text 2850
